      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a job-matching assistant. Score how well this remote job fits the candidate.\n\nCANDIDATE\n- Lives in Pakistan; can only take jobs open to Pakistan or worldwide.\n- Experience: Prompt Engineering Instructor (taught 50+ international learners, designed grading rubrics); builds AI agents and automations with the Claude API and Claude Code; AI output evaluation; video and data annotation; Canva content design; 8 years of client-facing project work.\n- Wants: AI trainer, LLM evaluation, AI quality analyst, prompt engineering, data annotation, AI automation or operations, AI content roles.\n- Not a fit: software or ML engineering, sales, jobs needing a CS/STEM degree, a PhD, or native English.\n\nJOB\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company_name }}\nWho can apply: {{ $json.candidate_required_location }}\nSalary: {{ $json.salary }}\nDescription: {{ $json.description.slice(0, 3000) }}\n\nReply ONLY with JSON in this format:\n{\"score\": 0-10, \"reason\": \"one short sentence\", \"apply\": true or false}",
